EPLL (fixed). Reset: postdiv2 = 1, postdiv1 = 3; with PERI_CRG_PLL9 (refdiv 2, fbdiv 125) FOUTVCO = 24 x 125 / 2 = 1500 MHz and POSTDIV output = 500 MHz (source of the fixed 250/125/100/83.3/50 MHz style clocks of DS Table 3-2 and of the 100 MHz SPI clock in the vendor driver).

