    reg {
        name = "ARM9 frequency mode and reset configuration register";
        desc = "PERI_CRG10 is an ARM9 frequency mode and reset configuration register.

ARM926 clock skip configuration: cpuclk_skipcfg = N disables N beats out of every 32 CPU clocks. Software writes cpuclk_skipcfg, then pulses cpuclk_loaden 0 -> 1 (DS: write the value, write 0 to loaden, write 1 to loaden). arm_core_srst_req resets only the ARM core.

Data sheet 3.2.7 PERI_CRG10 (offset 0x28, printed page 3-19, `hi3516cv300--Hi3516CV300-Hi3516EV100-Datasheet.txt` line 6020).";

